  {
   "ts": "1794646800.000100",
   "channel_id": "C07SRETRIAGE",
   "user_id": "U07TOBIN",
   "text": "Draft owners for Monday are in the desk folder (triage-draft-culprits.csv). Six simkit-topped groups plus the simctl one, so Sim Tools gets 7 again.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "reply_count": 0,
   "reactions": []
  },
  {
   "ts": "1794647400.000200",
   "channel_id": "C07SRETRIAGE",
   "user_id": "U07ODIL",
   "text": "Fine by us, drop them in our queue like last week. Most are callers holding the ticker wrong but we'll look.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "reply_count": 0,
   "reactions": []
  },
  {
   "ts": "1794648000.000300",
   "channel_id": "C07SRETRIAGE",
   "user_id": "U07KOFI",
   "text": "Reminder that internal/billing is Billing. If a crash is in internal/billing/queue please send it to us, not Messaging.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "reply_count": 0,
   "reactions": []
  },
  {
   "ts": "1794648600.000400",
   "channel_id": "C07SRETRIAGE",
   "user_id": "U07INES",
   "text": "Thanks all. Monday's routing follows the handbook and the ownership file as merged; requests in here don't change it.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "reply_count": 0,
   "reactions": []
  },
  {
   "ts": "1794649200.000500",
   "channel_id": "C07SRETRIAGE",
   "user_id": "U07SADE",
   "text": "Two hand edits to register titles last week got overwritten by the sync. Only Owner team and Root cause, please.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "reply_count": 0,
   "reactions": []
  },
  {
